# Arc: SailorArc | Scene: TheOldRoad4

translate pt strings:

    old "A heavy pause."
    new "Uma pausa pesada."

    old "A nature like this could never have existed in her home country, she realized. Simply because the ever growing masses of people would seize on it eventually."
    new "Uma natureza assim nunca poderia ter existido em seu país natal, ela percebeu. Simplesmente porque as massas em constante crescimento acabariam por se apropriar dela."

    old "Give yourself over to the soldiers"
    new "Entrega-te aos soldados"

    old "A crack rang out across the tent."
    new "Um estalo ecoou pela tenda."

    old "A group of five or so soldiers walked into the tent, already undressed."
    new "Um grupo de cinco ou mais soldados entrou na tenda, já despidos."

    old "Ask Sigmund to protect you"
    new "Peça a Sigismundo que o proteja"
